{"version":1,"content":"<p>PHP開發團隊於2026年10月21日正式發佈緊急安全更新，修復兩項嚴重安全漏洞。這兩項漏洞分別編號為CVE-2026-109618和CVE-2026-109619，均被評定為嚴重級別，可能允許攻擊者在無需登錄的情況下遠程執行代碼。官方強烈建議所有PHP用户立即升級至修復版本，以避免伺服器遭到攻擊。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583240.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.240804+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"bc6f31ebc878fe37dff4f7d5d6bfdcace60a843f011d308bb7f722f50ce08415","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}